---
import BaseLayout from '~/layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Hero from '~/components/Hero.astro';
import { SITE } from '~/lib/site';

const lastUpdated = 'May 11, 2026';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Terms & Conditions"
  description={`Terms & Conditions for ${SITE.name}. The terms that govern use of our website and services.`}
  breadcrumbs={[{ name: 'Home', url: '/' }, { name: 'Terms & Conditions', url: '/terms-and-conditions/' }]}
>
  <Hero
    eyebrow="Legal"
    title="Terms & Conditions"
    subtitle={`The terms that govern your use of our website and services.`}
    image="/images/hero/homepage.webp"
    breadcrumbs={[{ name: 'Home', url: '/' }, { name: 'Terms & Conditions', url: '/terms-and-conditions/' }]}
    goldLine
  />

  <section class="py-16 md:py-24 bg-white">
    <div class="container-site max-w-3xl mx-auto">
      <p class="text-sm text-ink-500 mb-10">Last updated: {lastUpdated}</p>

      <div class="prose-legal space-y-8 text-ink-700 leading-relaxed">
        <p>
          These Terms &amp; Conditions (“Terms”) govern your access to and use of
          <a href={SITE.url} class="text-brand-600 hover:text-brand-500"> {SITE.url}</a>
          and the products and services offered by {SITE.name} LLC (“{SITE.shortName}”, “we”, “us”, or “our”).
          By using our website or engaging us for services, you agree to these Terms.
        </p>

        <div>
          <h2 class="font-display text-2xl md:text-3xl text-ink-800 mb-3">Use of Our Website</h2>
          <p>You agree to use our website only for lawful purposes and in a way that does not infringe the rights of others or restrict their use of the site. You may not attempt to gain unauthorized access to any part of the site, our servers, or any connected systems.</p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="font-display text-2xl md:text-3xl text-ink-800 mb-3">Consultations & Quotes</h2>
          <p>Initial in-home consultations are complimentary and do not create a binding contract. Pricing provided during or after a consultation is an estimate based on the scope discussed; final pricing is confirmed in a written proposal or order agreement signed by both parties.</p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="font-display text-2xl md:text-3xl text-ink-800 mb-3">Orders, Deposits & Custom Work</h2>
          <p>All custom drapery, upholstery, window treatments, and related products are made-to-order. Orders are confirmed upon receipt of a signed proposal and the required deposit. Because each order is fabricated to your specifications:</p>
          <ul class="list-disc pl-6 mt-3 space-y-1">
            <li>Deposits are non-refundable once fabrication has begun.</li>
            <li>Custom orders cannot be cancelled, returned, or exchanged after production starts.</li>
            <li>Lead times are estimates and may be affected by supplier availability or shipping delays.</li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="font-display text-2xl md:text-3xl text-ink-800 mb-3">Measurements & Installation</h2>
          <p>When we measure and install, we stand behind the fit of our work. If a client provides their own measurements or alters site conditions after we have measured (for example, after window replacement or trim changes), {SITE.shortName} is not responsible for resulting fit issues.</p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="font-display text-2xl md:text-3xl text-ink-800 mb-3">Payment</h2>
          <p>Unless otherwise agreed in writing, the balance of each order is due upon completion of installation. Late payments may be subject to fees as permitted by Florida law.</p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="font-display text-2xl md:text-3xl text-ink-800 mb-3">Warranties</h2>
          <p>Manufactured products are covered by their respective manufacturer warranties (Hunter Douglas, Norman, Graber, Kravet, Stout, and other authorized partners). Our workmanship on custom drapery, upholstery, and installation is backed by our own guarantee. Warranties do not cover normal wear, sun damage, improper cleaning, accidents, or modifications made after installation.</p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="font-display text-2xl md:text-3xl text-ink-800 mb-3">Intellectual Property</h2>
          <p>All content on this website — including text, photography, designs, logos, and graphics — is the property of {SITE.name} LLC or its licensors and is protected by U.S. and international copyright laws. You may not reproduce, distribute, or use any content from this site without our prior written permission.</p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="font-display text-2xl md:text-3xl text-ink-800 mb-3">Limitation of Liability</h2>
          <p>To the fullest extent permitted by law, {SITE.name} LLC is not liable for any indirect, incidental, special, or consequential damages arising out of or related to your use of our website or services. Our total liability for any claim related to an order will not exceed the amount you paid for that order.</p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="font-display text-2xl md:text-3xl text-ink-800 mb-3">Third-Party Links</h2>
          <p>Our website may contain links to third-party sites. We do not control those sites and are not responsible for their content, privacy practices, or terms.</p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="font-display text-2xl md:text-3xl text-ink-800 mb-3">Governing Law</h2>
          <p>These Terms are governed by the laws of the State of Florida, without regard to conflict-of-law principles. Any disputes shall be resolved in the state or federal courts located in Pinellas County, Florida.</p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="font-display text-2xl md:text-3xl text-ink-800 mb-3">Changes to These Terms</h2>
          <p>We may update these Terms from time to time. Continued use of our website or services after changes are posted constitutes acceptance of the revised Terms.</p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="font-display text-2xl md:text-3xl text-ink-800 mb-3">Contact Us</h2>
          <p>Questions about these Terms? Please contact us:</p>
          <ul class="mt-3 space-y-1">
            <li><strong>{SITE.name} LLC</strong></li>
            <li>{SITE.address.locality}, {SITE.address.region}</li>
            <li>Phone: <a href={SITE.phoneHref} class="text-brand-600 hover:text-brand-500">{SITE.phone}</a></li>
            <li>Email: <a href={`mailto:${SITE.email}`} class="text-brand-600 hover:text-brand-500">{SITE.email}</a></li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
